            {"role": "Tested", "file": "contracts/airlock-credit/src/tests.rs", "line": 1744, "has": "fn the_cap_counts_what_the_borrower_holds_on_their_other_cards", "name": "the_cap_counts_what_the_borrower_holds_on_their_other_cards"}
          ]
        },
        {
          "n": "2.13",
          "kind": "limit",
          "text": "A raise of the Passport base that has applied also raises, for good, the draw a repay must keep to count toward a score, a tenth of the highest base so far; no call lowers it. The issuer can cancel a raise while it is pending, and anyone can apply it once it is due.",
          "status": "in force",
          "refs": [
